 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "nums is an integer list, 1 <= windowSize <= len(nums) and 0 <= k < windowSize. For every window nums[i:i + windowSize] (i = 0, 1, ..., len(nums) - windowSize), remove its k largest values (as a multiset: equal values are removed one at a time) and return the floor (toward negative infinity) of the average of the windowSize - k values that remain. The result has len(nums) - windowSize + 1 integers.",
